# ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# .dockerignore — excludes paths from the Docker build context.
# The `api` and `worker` images both build from context `.` with `COPY . .`,
# so anything listed here is NEVER baked into the images pushed to ECR and run
# on ECS Fargate.
# ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

# ── AI assistant / agent tooling ──────────────────────────────────────────────
# Keep the AI workflow out of shipped images. Covers config, rules, and context
# files for the common AI coding tools — at the repo root and any subdirectory.
# Claude Code / Anthropic
CLAUDE.md
**/CLAUDE.md
CLAUDE.local.md
**/CLAUDE.local.md
.claude/
**/.claude/
# OpenAI Codex / generic agent instruction files
AGENTS.md
**/AGENTS.md
.codex/
**/.codex/
# Google Gemini CLI
GEMINI.md
**/GEMINI.md
.gemini/
**/.gemini/
# Cursor
.cursor/
**/.cursor/
.cursorrules
**/.cursorrules
.cursorignore
# Windsurf / Codeium
.windsurf/
.windsurfrules
**/.windsurfrules
.codeium/
# GitHub Copilot
**/copilot-instructions.md
.github/instructions/
# Aider
.aider*
**/.aider*
.aiderignore
# Continue / Cline / Roo Code
.continue/
.clinerules
**/.clinerules
.roo/
.roomodes
.roorules
# OpenCode
opencode.json
**/opencode.json
.opencode/
# Other assistants (Sourcegraph Cody, Tabnine, generic .ai config)
.sourcegraph/
.cody/
.tabnine/
.ai/
# Model Context Protocol (MCP) server config
.mcp.json
**/.mcp.json
# Local knowledge base / "second brain" + dev handoff notes
KNOWLEDGE/
RESUME.md

# ── Secrets / environment ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Runtime env is injected via compose env_file/environment, never copied in.
.env
.env.*
**/.env
**/.env.*

# ── Version control / CI ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────
.git/
.gitignore
.gitattributes
.github/

# ── Python bytecode / build artifacts ─────────────────────────────────────────
__pycache__/
**/__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
**/*.py[cod]
*$py.class
*.so
*.egg
*.egg-info/
build/
dist/

# ── Virtual environments (image builds its own .venv via `uv sync`) ───────────
.venv/
**/.venv/
venv/
env/
ENV/

# ── Tooling caches ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
.uv-cache/
.pytest_cache/
.ruff_cache/
.mypy_cache/
.hypothesis/
.coverage
coverage.xml
htmlcov/
junit.xml

# ── Logs ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
*.log
logs/
celerybeat-schedule
celerybeat.pid

# ── Frontend (Next.js app is built & deployed separately) ─────────────────────
frontend/
**/node_modules/

# ── Infra / docs / tests not needed at runtime ────────────────────────────────
terraform/
docs/
tests/

# ── Docker / compose meta (not needed inside the image) ───────────────────────
Dockerfile*
**/Dockerfile*
docker-compose*.yml
.dockerignore

# ── OS / editor cruft ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
.DS_Store
**/.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
.idea/
.vscode/
*.swp
*.swo
*.swn
*~
